        "directions": [
          "Highlight Magenta on White",
          "White on Highlight Magenta"
        ]
      },
      "brand_preference": "Although Grounded Blue and Highlight Magenta are mathematically more accessible together, West Monroe templates generally prefer the visual interaction between Highlight Magenta and White. Use Highlight Magenta for large, bold text such as subheads and callouts on White, and for strong visual emphasis on Grounded Blue backgrounds."
    }
